    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44874" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπρόσκοπος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>far-seeing, cautious</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τῶν ἠθῶν εὐκινητότερον καὶ
					πολυτροπώτερον καὶ -πώτερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ptol.
					<u>Tetr.</u>
					173
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπρόσκοπος</span> (B).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>easily taking offence</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθύμῳ καὶ
				ἀσθενικῷ καὶ εὐπροσκόπῳ καὶ πρὸς πάντας
			δυσαρέστῳ</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				207
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπρόσκοπος</span>
		(A).</div>
